      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name}\n\nController used: Vive CE\n\nPlatform: steamVR\n\nIn this situation, it is no longer possible to fix the phys bone in the air using the previous method (prior to 2024.3.1).\n\nWe believe this may be due to the fact that the current bind setting does not allow you to specify the process of holding the phys bone with the trigger and fixing it in the air with the grip, which was done as part of the Vive advanced control process.\n\nWe have tried everything, but at this stage we cannot find a way to perform the conventional phys bone processing, so the solution is to change the bind itself to perform the same processing, or to revert to the processing before the update.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
