      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name} The original functionality for posing physbones on Vive was with the grip. Users are expecting grip to pose instead of trigger and are having trouble now. We currently have no way to rebind this functionality to achieve grip pose again without sacrificing other functionality. \n\nSee https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1491-vive-controllers-physbone-pose-w-trigger-full-pull-is-unintuitive",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
