      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{627e94e69bf04e1ede28a21b|full_name} \n\nUsing a Vive Pro through SteamVR, wired. Vive wands with x2 basestations\n\nI can no longer grab dynamic bones using my Vive Pro wands, no matter what input scheme I'm using in SteamVR.\n\nOriginally, pressing the trigger would grab the bone, and the grip would pose it (if posing was allowed on the bone).\n\nNow, pressing the trigger locks/poses the bone in place, without actually grabbing it. Grip doesn't do anything. I can no longer grab the bones.\n\nReverting to the old hand system in the wheel menu doesn't change anything. No settings have any effect on it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
