      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "A friend of mine has trouble grabbing/posing physbones with new binding controls, using vive pro and default vive wands.\n\nUsing physbones for example, the only one binding option is \"Interact\" in steamvr, instead of a different option like \"Pose\".\n\nbefore the binding update, he could pose bones with Grip, and click on world buttons with trigger.\n\nNow you're forced to bind interact to grip to pose the physbones, but then you'd be forced to click menus with Grip.\n\nthe only way to grab physbones without posing them is to half-press the trigger analog using the new binding system",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
